  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6605.09 Annual Permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6605.09 Annual Permit.\n\n(a) An annual permit shall be valid for one year from the date of issuance unless the permit is suspended pursuant to Saf-C 6605.06.\n\n(b) A holder of an annual permit shall:\n\n(1) Confirm the shipment schedule with state police communications within 30 days of a planned shipment;\n\n(2) Confirm the shipment schedule with state police communications within 24 hours of the scheduled departure; and\n\n(3) Immediately notify state police communications of a shipment delay or cancellation.\n\nSource. #7287, eff 5-24-00; ss by #9154, eff 5-8-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6600.html"
